      "title": "Private account context and practice fixture",
      "summary": "Development integration fixture only; not authored curriculum or a catalog count.",
      "objective": "Repair Mira\u2019s account: use review as the primary group and retain only audit and the new reports group as supplementary membership. Create reports with GID2200. Preserve numeric user identities, the other account, service records and all content/modes. Old-primary-group entries in Mira\u2019s home must follow the primary change; outside ownership and different-group home evidence must stay unchanged. No password or login behavior is required.",
      "difficulty": "Beginner",
      "minutes": 15,
      "steps": [
        "Inspect the supplied records",
        "Repair membership and primary group",
        "Verify retained evidence"
      ],
      "guide": [],
      "hints": [
        "Inspect id and getent before choosing a complete supplementary list.",
        "Changing the primary group affects old-group home entries, not outside files."
